r.\n- If you find yourself in a situation in which the scenario does not provide enough information for you to continue the conversation, generate the '###OUT-OF-SCOPE###' token to end the conversation.\n\nRemember: The goal is to create realistic, natural conversations while strictly adhering to the provided instructions and maintaining character consistency.","source":{"artifact":{"path":"result-bundles/tau2-bench/telecom/v0.1.3/gpt-4.1/2026-10-20/results.json","sha256":"28aa8728547442c392fe1c45e03c9c4f249cfe1912acf4ddc302feab2b02caae"},"config":{"path":"result-bundles/tau2-bench/telecom/v0.1.3/gpt-4.1/2026-10-20/config.json","scope":"primary-result","sha256":"5738b80e98382e07668d62b1f807764d9048c003eedf53798271e1f5fb8d85c8"},"role":"primary-result","task_pointer":"/tasks/78","task_run_pointer":"/simulations/420"},"task_run_id":"tau2-bench/telecom/v0.1.3/gpt-4.1/2026-10-20/f22683f3-a4b0-4029-89fe-5bde1790e567","trajectory":{"messages":[{"content":"Hi! How can I help you today?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":0,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:38:02.266232","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":0,"usage":null},{"content":"Hi there! I’m having trouble sending MMS messages from my phone. It’s been happening for the past few hours, and I’d really like to get it working again. Can you help me figure out what’s going on?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":1,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T19:38:03.344334","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":1,"usage":{"completion_tokens":48,"prompt_tokens":2372}},{"content":"I can help you troubleshoot your MMS issue. To get started, I’ll need to identify your account. Could you please provide one of the following:\n- The phone number associated with your account,\n- Your full name and date o